  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "we are, it's\nstill the middle of summer. It was \nnicer in the Digimon world...",
      "_offset": 297,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "?? Why?",
      "_offset": 377,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "You could go to the snowy\nmountains or the sea anytime you\nwanted.",
      "_offset": 385,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Ah, you're right!",
      "_offset": 452,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "I wonder how Yukidarumon's doing\nright now...",
      "_offset": 470,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Yeah, it'd be nice if he could\ncome to Tokyo and cool us off.",
      "_offset": 516,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "All right, Agumon! Let's go cool\nourselves off!",
      "_offset": 578,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Cool ourselves off... where?",
      "_offset": 626,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Just come on!",
      "_offset": 655,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Aaaaaah... it's so nice...",
      "_offset": 672,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "It really is... it's like\nheaven...",
      "_offset": 699,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Ah! Look at this!",
      "_offset": 735,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Whoa, looks like snow's falling!",
      "_offset": 753,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "That's a souvenir snowglobe. Maybe\nYukidarumon would like it if you\nshowed it to him.",
      "_offset": 786,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "I wonder if everyone in the\nDigimon world's doing okay?",
      "_offset": 872,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "That's right! I bet we can send an\nemail to the Digimon world.",
      "_offset": 928,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Let's take a picture and send a\nsummer greeting card!",
      "_offset": 991,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "I don't really get what a summer\ngreeting card is, but it sounds\nfun!",
      "_offset": 1045,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Doesn't it? Excuse me! I'd like to\nbuy this snowglobe!",
      "_offset": 1115,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Aaaah! It's Meramon!",
      "_offset": 1173,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "...He seems different from the\nMeramon we met in the Yokomon\nvillage...",
      "_offset": 1194,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "What's going on? It's so chilly,\nI'm frozen to the bone...",
      "_offset": 1267,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "I'm mad... I want to punch someone\nin the vicinity!",
      "_offset": 1326,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Agumon! We have to stop him!",
      "_offset": 1378,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 1407,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "It was so hot outside, I let the\nheat get to my head... I'm\nsorry...",
      "_offset": 1413,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "This isn't the Digimon world, so\nbe careful.",
      "_offset": 1482,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Be careful.",
      "_offset": 1527,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Ah!",
      "_offset": 1539,
      "_length": 3,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "What's wrong, Tai?",
      "_offset": 1543,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "The snowglobe's broken...",
      "_offset": 1565,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "What?! Now we can't send our mail\nto Yukidarumon.",
      "_offset": 1591,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "It's my fault... at least let me\ngive you this in apology.",
      "_offset": 1641,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Ah, thanks.",
      "_offset": 1700,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "The snowglobe's still broken,\nthough...",
      "_offset": 1712,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}